          "title": "You'll want to know: میچ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "میچ — maich — \"a match (a game)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کل ہماری ٹیم کا میچ ہے۔ kal hamārī ṭīm kā maich hai. Our team has a match tomorrow."
